<title>SPAIN: DNIB issues 12 billion 5-year peseta Matador.</title>
<headline>DNIB issues 12 billion 5-year peseta Matador.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>De National Investeringsbank is issuing a five-year 12 billion peseta Matador with an issue price of par, said the joint lead managers and book-runners Citibank and Banco de Negocios Argentaria.</p>
<p>The issue expires on November 7 2001 and is callable on November 7 1998.</p>
<p>The coupon is 6.68 percent for the first two years and 7.27 percent the next three.</p>
<p>The Moody's rating on the issue is AA3. The commission fee was 1.435 percent.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
